{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe agreement's allocation rule for plots is: \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\" [[cite:obs-e4cc585320443fca427970290809b27059098507 \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]]\n\nThe agreement does not state the physical size of a plot; the only statement about plots in the agreement is \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\" [[cite:obs-e4cc585320443fca427970290809b27059098507 \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]]","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the allocation rule verbatim from the agreement and noted that no plot size is specified, citing the sole relevant sentence from the Garden agreement."}